  "description": "DICOMweb for Plgic.Dicom: DICOM JSON Model and Native DICOM Model (XML) serializers, a streaming multipart/related reader and writer with size limits, and an HttpClient-based QIDO-RS / WADO-RS / STOW-RS client that streams studies as IAsyncEnumerable without buffering whole responses. Free for evaluation, non-commercial use and small companies (under USD 1M annual revenue); commercial production use by larger organisations needs a paid license. No license key required today.",
